    "status": "DEFINITION_EXCERPT",
    "text": "R&D capital to assets is the weighted sum of lagged R&D expenditures scaled by the assets (at). We replace xrd with 0 if xrd is missing and compute the numerator as $xrd_t + .8 xrd_{t-1}+ .6xrd_{t-2} + .4 xrd_{t-3} + .2 xrd_{t-4}$. Replace RDcap with missing before  1980 or if firm is in upper two thirds of market cap (shrout*abs(prc)) distribution in a month.",
    "truncated": false
  },
